%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhy the Terrace House Hinosaka? It's just a few dozen\nsquare meters in the middle of a residential area.\d%K%P
「为什么是『Terrace House阳之坂』呢？\n为什么是，那种住宅区正中，不过百十来方的一块地呢？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...What are you trying to say?\d%K%P
「…您这是什么意思呢？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou want that land, right? East Hagimori 3-24, right next\nto your house.\d%K%P
「盯上那块地了吧你们？\n就是你家的隔壁，东萩守三丁目２４番地」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dAnd what if I did?\d%K%P
「如果是这样呢？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI don't think you can do much by just buying that single\nplot of land...\d%K%P
「就算你们把那个地方弄到手，\n我感觉你们也进行不了什么大规模的开发啊…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
The thing we discussed with Mr. Retired and the others...%K%P
以前，曾和老爷子他们谈过这事。%K%P
A plot of land in the middle of a residential area that\nwas unfit to be used for larger building projects seemed\nlike it wouldn't be worth the trouble of acquisition for a\ncompany like the Sawashima Group.%K%P
对于这种住宅街正中的一小块地来说，\n泽嶋房地产所经营建设的高层大楼，市郊百货楼之类的建筑\n所具有的规模与之相去甚远，这是个不争的事实。%K%P
If they were serious, they would have to buy out the\nentirety of East Hagimori...%K%P
如果那个企业真心想有什么行动的话，\n就一定是有必要将东荻守三丁目整个弄到手%K%P
...and rebuild the whole district.%K%P
然后，把东荻守整条街都铲掉重建，进行大开发…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTo me, it doesn't seem like you're doing this solely for\nthe land. I can't help but think that you've got another,\nmore important goal.\d%K%P
「我无论如何也不相信你是只为了得到那块土地而行动，\n一定是有着什么其他的、更大的目的…」%K%P
